  Name: Moodguy
  Description: "In the first Age, in the first Battle, when the mood first veined,
    one stood. He chose the path of perpetual fury. In his neverending disgust he
    found no peace, and with boiling blood he scoured the wittles plains, seeking
    revenge against the humorous who had robbed him. And those that tasted the bite
    of his sword named him \u2026 Mood Slayer"
